ADAPTATION NOTE
---------------
Wort für Wort is a German-language adaptation of the interaction concept
originally published as 一字一世界 at https://chinesereader.net by @pourteaux.
The German stories and vocabulary were newly written for this edition.

CEFR is a public framework and is not owned or claimed by this project. The
level labels are practical guidance, not an official certification or an
exhaustive CEFR word list.
